<decision #track.add_mission_actor_sets.actor_set_shape {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = ["design.md" "track.xml"]
}
(
  <question ?>TaskGroup 如何局部改变四 Actor 的工作方式？</?>
  <recommendation ?>每个 ActorSet 必须完整，TaskGroup 以 actor-set 属性整组替换，最近祖先优先。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户同意 Mission 默认 ActorSet 与 TaskGroup 局部覆盖，并允许不同阶段使用多个四 Actor 组合。</?>
    <decision-text ?>禁止逐角色隐式 merge；覆盖引用完整 ActorSet。</?>
    <rationale ?>防止阶段继承产生难以观察的半套控制角色。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission accepted decision `actor_sets` 与 coding AttractorCheck 结论。</?>
  )
>
)
>

<decision #track.add_mission_actor_sets.workspace_binding_boundary {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = ["design.md" "track.xml"]
}
(
  <question ?>跨项目 workspace 路径应落在哪里？</?>
  <recommendation ?>只在 impl-mission 当前 session runtime 中保存 WorkspaceBinding；mission 仅保存 ProjectRef。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户明确拒绝可 Git 管理的 workspaces.xml，并接受 ProjectRef + session-local WorkspaceBinding。</?>
    <decision-text ?>路径不得写入任何持久 Codument 文件；未绑定外部 ProjectRef 的实际态为 UNBOUND。</?>
    <rationale ?>开发者机器目录不同，路径不是共享项目事实。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission accepted decision `project_binding`。</?>
  )
>
)
>
